                                                "sense_id": "2440b352-84f5-3d07-abfb-be371dc876a7",
                                                "text": "If you also knew how to combine foods—that is, what foods eaten together “set well,” you need never have indigestion, constipation or any of the headachy, stomachachy ills they lead to."
                                            }
